<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>23初级会计实务22条公式</title>
<script>
window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };
</script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js" async></script>
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #e5e5e5;
    font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px 0;
  }
  .device {
    width: 560px;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    position: relative;
  }
  /* status bar */
  .statusbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 6px 18px 2px 18px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #000;
  }
  .statusbar .dots {
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .statusbar .right-icons {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  /* toolbar */
  .toolbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 6px 16px 10px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: #333;
  }
  .toolbar .left-group, .toolbar .right-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .toolbar .icon {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  /* content area */
  .content {
    padding: 18px 20px 30px 20px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .title {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #000;
    margin: 6px 0 18px 0;
  }
  .title .red {
    color: #e02020;
  }
  .section-head {
    color: #e02020;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16.5px;
    margin: 14px 0 8px 0;
  }
  .formula {
    color: #29a3ef;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin: 6px 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .plain {
    color: #000;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin: 6px 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  /* right margin ruled lines (notebook lines visible on right edge) */
  .ruled-margin {
    position: absolute;
    top: 60px;
    bottom: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 16px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent 0px,
      transparent 30px,
      #ccc 30px,
      #ccc 31px
    );
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  .placeholder {
    border: 1px dashed #aaa;
    color: #888;
    font-size: 13px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="device">

  <!-- Status bar -->
  <div class="statusbar">
    <div class="dots">••••</div>
    <div class="right-icons">
      <span>📶 86%🔋</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Toolbar -->
  <div class="toolbar">
    <div class="left-group">
      <span class="icon">‹</span>
      <span class="icon">⬆</span>
      <span class="icon">↻</span>
    </div>
    <div class="left-group" style="margin-left:10px;">
      <span class="icon">T</span>
      <span class="icon">✎</span>
      <span class="icon">○</span>
      <span class="icon">⬚</span>
      <span class="icon">＋</span>
    </div>
    <div class="right-group">
      <span class="icon">🎤</span>
      <span class="icon">＋</span>
      <span class="icon">⋮</span>
      <span class="icon">▢</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="content">

    <div class="title">23初级会计<span class="red">实务</span>22条公式</div>

    <div class="section-head">1. 固定资产余额.净值.价值公式:</div>
    <div class="formula">账面余额=固定资产账面原价</div>
    <div class="formula">账面净值=固定资产原价-累计折旧</div>
    <div class="formula">账面价值=固定资产原价-固定资产减值准备-累计折旧</div>
    <div class="plain">旧</div>

    <div class="section-head">2.无形资产资产余额.净值.价值公式:</div>
    <div class="formula">账面余额=无形资产账面原价</div>
    <div class="formula">账面净值=无形资产原价-累计摊销</div>
    <div class="formula">账面价值=无形资产原价-无形资产减值准备-累计摊销</div>
    <div class="plain">销</div>

    <div class="section-head">3. 存货采购成本:</div>
    <div class="plain">=买价+进口关税+其他税费+运费+装卸费+保险费</div>
    <div class="plain">+其他可归属于存货达到预定可使用状态 前的合理费用(在有货采购过程中发生的仓储费、包装费、运输途中的合理损耗、入库前的挑 选整理费用)</div>

    <div class="section-head">4. 月末一次加权平均法计算公式:</div>
    <div class="plain">存货单位成本=（月初结存存货成本+Σ(本月各批进货的实际单位成本本月各批进货的数量) ）/(月初结存存货数量+本月各批进货数量之和)</div>

    <div class="ruled-margin"></div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
